  "method": "Every I/O and edge-case matrix row of the Package B spec maps to tests that summarize-checks.py requires to pass in the named receipt log (focused-race: ten race-enabled repetitions; full-unit: one complete suite run). Native tests drive the pinned amqp091-go client over net.Pipe against an in-process protocol peer that sends basic.return, content header and body before the ACK; fake-broker tests exercise public Publish classification. negative-controls.receipt.json shows that each Package B behavior's removal fails these tests.",
